    ("annotating", "tools/test_setter_error.sh", "a clue the setter printed wrong is annotated as printed: the anagram mismatch tools/data/setter_error.json names for that light passes, with a walkthrough saying so, every other mismatch still fails, and a row that is neither a whole-answer nor a partial anagram of what the clue prints is refused"),
